id=usbmanager_dcs
name=USB Manager (no LSPosed)
version=v1.3.0
versionCode=130
author=@Dev_DcS
description=Asks what to do every time you plug into a computer (USB mode + ADB per connection). USB guard: restarts the phone if an unknown device is connected while locked and it is not unlocked in time. Optional full USB data block (kernel-enforced on the dev-dcs GKI builds) and auto restart when not unlocked for a set time. No Xposed needed.
